  "plain": "A podcast host, Jesse Michels, tells of a craft said to have crashed in 1948 at Hart Canyon near Aztec, New Mexico, drawing on Behind the Flying Saucers, a book by the writer Frank Scully. In his telling, once a new road had been cut to the site, a heavy vehicle called a dragon wagon backed its way up to haul the craft away, a detail that, if true, would point to an organized military recovery."
